@startuml
title Reschedule a session or a course timetable
start
:<b>Center Manager</b>\nSelect a new time and request preview;
:<b>System</b>\nCompute the resulting schedule, preserving individual session overrides;
if (Every affected old and new start meets the notice period?) then (Yes)
  :<b>System</b>\nCheck operating frames, coach and room availability;
  :<b>System</b>\nCheck booked members and pending payment seats against other courses;
  if (Any resource or member conflict?) then (Yes)
    :<b>System</b>\nReject the request and retain the existing schedule;
  else (No)
    :<b>Center Manager</b>\nConfirm the preview;
    :<b>System</b>\nLock the schedule and repeat all policy checks;
    if (Still valid?) then (Yes)
      :<b>System</b>\nSave sessions, notification outbox and audit atomically;
    else (No)
      :<b>System</b>\nRoll back and request a new preview;
    endif
  endif
else (No)
  :<b>System</b>\nReject with the configured notice period (at least 48 hours);
endif
stop
@enduml
